{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/statistics/national-travel-attitudes-study-wave-2","content_id":"2b5592d5-fa47-412e-b911-d76d47858fd5","description":"Peoples' attitudes to different aspects of transport, from the second wave of the National Travel Attitudes Study. ","details":{"attachments":[{"accessible":true,"alternative_format_contact_email":"webmasterdft@dft.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"5e1f2f3940f0b611435cc671","filename":"national-travel-attitudes-study-wave-2.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":400575,"filename":"national-travel-attitudes-study-wave-2.pdf","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"3922245","isbn":"","number_of_pages":16,"title":"National Travel Attitudes Study: Wave 2 report","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e1f2f3940f0b611435cc671/national-travel-attitudes-study-wave-2.pdf"},{"accessible":false,"alternative_format_contact_email":"webmasterdft@dft.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"5e1f2f7ee5274a4f0f57554d","filename":"national-travel-attitudes-study-wave-2.zip"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/zip","file_size":222858,"filename":"national-travel-attitudes-study-wave-2.zip","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"3922251","isbn":"","title":"National Travel Attitudes Study: Wave 2 data tables","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e1f2f7ee5274a4f0f57554d/national-travel-attitudes-study-wave-2.zip"},{"accessible":true,"alternative_format_contact_email":"webmasterdft@dft.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"5e1f2fbde5274a4ed3052a5f","filename":"ntas-pre-release-access.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":79416,"filename":"ntas-pre-release-access.pdf","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"3922255","isbn":"","number_of_pages":1,"title":"National Travel Attitudes Study: pre-release access","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e1f2fbde5274a4ed3052a5f/ntas-pre-release-access.pdf"}],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>Statistics on attitudes around travel and transport issues, asked of people who have completed the main National Travel Survey.</p>\n\n<p>Questions in wave 2 were put to 2,654 individuals and includes responses on a wide array of topics, including</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>Active transport (walking and cycling)</li>\n  <li>Road journeys and the environment</li>\n  <li>Road congestion</li>\n  <li>Road safety</li>\n  <li>Public transport</li>\n  <li>Transport and disability</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Headline figures include:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>61% of respondents are in favour of Low Emission Zones (LEZ)</li>\n  <li>63% of respondents feel that the law around driving whilst under the influence of drugs is not being properly enforced</li>\n  <li>70% of respondents support increased accessibility on public transport, even if this increases fares</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2 id=\"contact-us\">Contact us</h2>\n<div class=\"contact contact\" id=\"contact_1340\">\n    <p class=\"govuk-body\">National Travel Survey statistics</p>\n\n\n    <div>\n        <p class=\"govuk-body govuk-!-margin-bottom-4\">\n          Email <a class=\"govuk-link\" href=\"mailto:national.travelsurvey@dft.gov.uk\">national.travelsurvey@dft.gov.uk</a>\n        </p>\n\n\n    </div>\n\n\n</div>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2020-01-16T09:30:05Z"}],"document_type_label":"Official Statistics","documents":["<section data-module=\"ga4-link-tracker\" class=\"gem-c-attachment govuk-!-margin-bottom-6\">\n  <div class=\"gem-c-attachment__thumbnail govuk-!-display-none-print\">\n    <a class=\"govuk-link\" target=\"_self\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-h